---
import H1 from "@components/h1.astro";
import InfoLayout from "@layouts/InfoLayout.astro";
---

<InfoLayout>
     <div class="p-4 sm:pt-8 sm:px-12 pb-20 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between gap-32">
          <div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-12">
               <H1> Get to know DDD </H1>

               <!--Cambiar enlace -->
               <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-500 text-balance">
                    <a href="https://www.instagram.com/delnidd/" target="_blank" class="underline underline-offset-4 decoration-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-50 hover:decoration-zinc-200">
                         Daniel Daryanani Delgado
                    </a>
                     Regular guy from the Canary Islands, Tenerife. Does like improving all his skills in the understanding of life how we know it.
                    My goal is just to make things greater to people, how to do it? Good question i dont have the asnwer but i do my best. <strong>Everyone can do what they want but people dont know what they want</strong>

                    Dialogue, and analysis are things that he likes. 
                    

                    <strong>Keep things dynamic and keep in your own way.</strong>
                    
               </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2 text-base sm:text-lg">
               <h2 class="px-4 text-zinc-400 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-zinc-500">Achievements</h2>

               <ul class="px-4 text-zinc-400 list-disc list-outside">
                    <li>Bachelor Degree in VideoGame Development</li>
                    <li>Drone filmaker and editor</li>
                    <li>Experience in data analysis</li>
                    <li>QuiroPractice medium level module</li>
                    <li>Solo trip traveler</li>
               </ul>
          </div>
     </div>
</InfoLayout>
